This project is licensed in two parts, because it contains two kinds of thing.
Read the part that covers the file you are interested in.

  1. The game — code, writing, characters, design.  © 2026 Grant van Zyl,
     licensed CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.  Everything except the files listed in part 2.

  2. The character sprite art.  Third-party pixel art by the Liberated Pixel
     Cup community, licensed OGA-BY 3.0 (some contributions CC0).  NOT covered
     by part 1 — see below.

The split is deliberate.  Part 1's NoDerivatives term is ours to place on our
own work; it is not ours to place on somebody else's art, and doing so would
misrepresent the terms that art actually carries.


